  "body": "Narrow Action Server RCC source-snapshot/failed-reload correction for the approved integration line, plus verified worker-fixture compatibility corrections. This is not full #134 acceptance.\n\nCandidate head: `77373111c9fa43dbee005a9bf7f864e3aa883446` (tree `b0f7700783f808503c13063d4ba6c1e955fbdcb4`), remote-ref verified. The branch includes the approved `c6b6820` integration merge.\n\nChanges:\n- Discard only newly created snapshots on package YAML validation failure; preserve reused and last-good snapshots.\n- Retain earlier source generations across standalone imports because an import can share a datadir with live workers; lease-safe source generation collection is not implemented.\n- Pin only Runtime-executed test fixtures to published Actions Core 1.0.2. Runtime worker imports `actions.server_integration`; older fixture pins 0.10.0 could not resolve and 1.0.0 bootstrapped but failed before creating Action results.\n- Receipts bind Git commit/tree and imported module bytes; forced stop and natural API shutdown remain distinct outcomes.\n\nVerification:\n- PASS: pinned RCC v18.19.3 Doctor, Bootstrap and ToolkitTest (34 passed); Poetry 2.1.1 installed local package environments. Current Actions Core import resolves to this checkout, version 1.0.2.\n- PASS: source snapshot/cleanup regressions and existing natural shutdown review on exact `2def236a` remain valid for unchanged production modules.\n- PASS: real RCC HTTP tests `test_full_run` and `test_full_run_with_env_build` with corrected published Core pin, 2 passed in 18.49s. Log: `/workspaces/actions-worker-state/devsy-rcc-local-acceptance/fixture-rcc-1.0.2/http-worker-fixture-focus.log` (SHA-256 `50f92f29602a0b155a70fe5b968fda08a4d8672e44ca9933a84b5d4e1a6d35ba`). `test_secrets_simple` and `test_run_actions_with_custom_pythonpath` also passed.\n- PASS: Ruff 0.1.15, configured touched-file formatting/Isort/mypy, and `git diff --check`.\n- Shared baseline results remain failing: template listing expects four names while both `46a06485` and this branch return the added `mcp-v2-showcase`; OpenAPI/import/whitelist obtained files are byte-identical between matched main and current source. No golden fixtures were changed.\n- The earlier 31-failure full-suite log was from before RCC Bootstrap/PATH/candidate-Core correction. The declared full suite has not been rerun after those corrections and fixture pin updates. Full configured mypy previously reported 19 errors only in the separately owned Work Items UI harness; that file remains untouched.\n- Natural shutdown on exact `2def236a` was independently reviewed: HTTP shutdown 200, controlled Runtime exit 1, RCC terminal exit 0. The receipt is separate from forced-stop returncode 0 and does not claim complete descendant reaping.\n\nKnown unresolved items: baseline-identical OpenAPI/template goldens, generated OAuth config absent in this checkout, `mdl` unavailable, and full package suite/hosted CI not yet rerun on this checkpoint. Windows ACL, frozen Runtime, strict-remote and complete descendant cleanup remain open.\n",
